  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Apoio &#xe0; Gest&#xe3;o das Finan&#xe7;as P&#xfa;blicas, das Empresas P&#xfa;blicas, Parcerias P&#xfa;blico-Privadas (PPP) e Inclus&#xe3;o Financeira em Angola  (AGEPI)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(14, 16, 26); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;Building on the PEFA&apos;s guidance, the contribution to Expertise France aims at supporting the Government&apos;s reform agenda in three areas: 1) PFM and transparency of public administration, 2) Governance of the State-owned Enterprises (SOEs) and Public Private Partnerships (PPPs), 3) Inclusiveness and sustainability of the financial sector. This technical assistance is part of the Team Europe Initiative (TEI) for Angola, &quot;Diversification of Economy and Public Financial Management&quot;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
